1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:04,567
Six places. Six nights. And one minute
that keeps coming back. 6:40.

2
00:00:05,067 --> 00:00:19,967
This is the full story of what
happened after the lights went out. A
silent school. A mall that kept a
light burning. A town that isn't on
the map. A train with no stations. A
phone that rings at 4:44. And a
morning when everyone was gone.

3
00:00:20,467 --> 00:00:29,033
One question runs through all of it.
Why is it always 6:40? I'll answer it
at the very end. And I'll tell you
where we sleep next.
